rtunities: Banking Financial Software: Advanced Neo Bank ++ (2)\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 768px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fmedia%2Fpersonal-accounting-app-04.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"prose-blog mt-8\" dir=\"ltr\"><hr />\n<h1>Continuing from the previous article about<a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%85%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\"> Investment Opportunities in Neo-Banking Financial Software (1)</a>, we will provide more details on the types of neo-banks and financial software.</h1>\n<h2>What features does the N26 Neo-Bank have?</h2>\n<h3>It is one of the pioneers of neo-banks in Europe, founded in Germany in 2013. This bank offers various features and services to its users, which include the following:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Secure bank account and borderless payments: N26 users can create an online bank account and easily make international payments.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Bank card: N26 provides its users with Mastercard or Maestro bank cards. These cards can be used for online shopping, payments in stores, cash withdrawals from ATMs, and more.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Support for multiple currencies: N26 allows its users to manage more than 20 world currencies. Users can easily make international payments with their bank card.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Smart financial management: N26 offers its users features such as budgeting, expense management, and wallet management. These features help users to have better financial planning.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Mobile and online banking: N26 users can easily manage their banking services through the mobile app or the bank's website.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Insurance services: N26 provides insurance services for its users. These services include travel insurance, car insurance, and home insurance.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Customer support services: N26 provides customer support services to its users. These services include phone support, online chat, and support via email.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>High security: N26 uses advanced security technologies to maintain the security of its user accounts. Additionally, users can use tools such as card locking, sending alerts for any suspicious transactions, or limiting their card's credit limit.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Travel card: N26 offers its users a travel card with the ability to make fee-free payments in European countries.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Special cards: N26 offers some of its users special cards such as Metal and Business cards that provide access to additional features like higher ATM withdrawal limits, travel insurance, and legal consultation services.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>In summary, N26 offers a variety of features and services to its users, including a secure bank account, bank card, support for multiple currencies, smart financial management, mobile and online banking, insurance services, customer support services, high security, and special cards.</h3>\n<h4>N26 has not announced the exact number of its users, but according to various reports, the number of users of this bank exceeds 5 million worldwide. It should also be noted that the number of users of this bank is constantly increasing due to its rapid growth and increasing demand for its banking services.</h4>\n<h4>Currently, N26 is one of the largest neo-banks in Europe and the world, and in 2021, its market value reached approximately $9 billion. It should also be noted that due to the rapid growth this bank has had in recent years, its market value is constantly increasing.</h4>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>Chime is an American neo-bank that allows you to do all your banking completely online. Below, we mention some of the features of this bank:</h3>\n<h4>1- No subscription fee: By subscribing to Chime, you can use all of its banking services without any cost.</h4>\n<h4>2- Chime Visa Bank Card: With a Chime Visa bank card, you can easily shop anywhere in the world.</h4>\n<h4>3- Over 50,000 free ATMs: With your Chime Visa bank card, you can access over 50,000 ATMs worldwide.</h4>\n<h4>4- Fast money transfer: Using the Chime app, you can easily and without any cost transfer money to others.</h4>\n<h4>5- Credit building: Using the Chime Credit Builder Visa Credit Card, you can improve your personal credit and add credit to your account.</h4>\n<h4>6- Insurance: Chime will pay for your new car's insurance, so if your car is involved in an accident, you won't incur any costs.</h4>\n<h4>7- Financial management tools: Chime offers financial management tools that help you manage your budget and get paid for the remaining money after your expenses.</h4>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4>8- Reward program: By using the Chime reward program, you can benefit from discounts and digital currencies for online purchases.</h4>\n<h4>9- Support services: Chime offers 24/7 online support services, allowing you to contact an expert for any questions or problems.</h4>\n<h4>10- Multiple cards: With Chime, you can activate up to 3 Chime bank cards on one mobile device. In other words, if your family members also have access to Chime, they can use one Chime account with different cards.</h4>\n<h4>However, it should be noted that some Chime features such as insurance and credit building may only be accessible to some users, for example, only to those who live in the United States and conduct their banking activities in the US.</h4>\n<h3>The exact number of Chime users has not been publicly announced, but according to the company, by 2020, more than 8 million users had registered with this online bank.</h3>\n<h3>Also, the current value of Chime has not been publicly announced. The last time the value of this company was announced was in late 2020, and at that time, Chime was estimated to be worth over $5 billion. However, this amount may have changed given the ever-increasing growth of this online bank.</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>What features does the Monzo neo-bank have?</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>Monzo, a British online bank, provides various features for its users. Some of Monzo's features include:</h3>\n<h4>1- Bank card: Monzo provides its users with a Mastercard credit card or a current account debit card, which they can use to easily shop and withdraw money from their current account.</h4>\n<h4>2- Mobile app: Monzo users can use their mobile app to manage their current account, pay bills, transfer money, view transactions, and manage their personal budget.</h4>\n<h4>3- Cardless cash withdrawal: Monzo users can generate a QR code through their mobile app to withdraw money from banks that cooperate with Monzo, and use it instead of their bank card.</h4>\n<h4>4- Credit scoring based on shopping habits: Monzo allows its users to categorize their purchases using their current account data and easily see how much money they have spent on each category of purchases.</h4><h4>5. Personal Budget Management: Monzo provides tools for personal budget management that enable users to manage their money for each spending category, such as groceries, transportation, and more.</h4>\n\n\n\n<h3>Monzo is a neobank that offers the following services to its users:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h4>Bank Card: Monzo offers a new bank card called \"Monzo Card\" with its unique pink color that can be used in supported countries. The card is provided free of charge to users and can be used for purchases in stores and online, withdrawing cash from ATM machines, and converting to a payment card for use abroad.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Mobile App: Monzo offers a free mobile app to its users where they can perform their banking operations. Using this app, users can view their account balance, manage their payments, set budgets, and pay off debts.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Security: Monzo uses advanced security methods to ensure the financial security of its users. This bank is particularly trying to prevent online fraud.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Support: Monzo offers 24-hour support to its users, and users can contact the support team using the mobile app, phone, or email.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Financial Tools: Monzo offers features such as financial tools and budgeting to its users. Using these tools, users can manage their expenses</h4>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Other features that Monzo Bank offers include:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h4>24/7 Support: Using the Monzo app, you can receive specialized bank support to resolve your issues at any time of day or night.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Free Cash Withdrawals: Unlike many other banks, withdrawing cash from ATMs anywhere in the world with a Monzo card is done without any fees.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Unbiased Expense Assessment: Monzo allows its users to assess their expenses in different categories, such as food, drinks, and transportation. This assessment helps users improve their spending and save money.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>\"Metal\" Type Credit Card: For its credit card, Monzo offers a type of card with a metal body that, in addition to its beautiful appearance, has more durability and security than plastic cards.</h4>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>By the end of 2021, Monzo's user base has grown to over 5 million people. Also, based on the latest valuation in September 2021, Monzo's value is estimated at $2 billion</h4>\n<p> </p>\n\n<h2>What are the features of Ally Bank and Varo neobanks?</h2>\n\n<h3>Ally Bank and Varo Bank are both neobanks that allow you to manage your bank statements without the need for a physical presence. Below, we examine the features of these two banks:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h2>Ally Bank:</h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Ally Bank is an online bank that allows you to access your bank account through its mobile app. This bank also provides its customers with a free bank card. Below, we mention some of Ally Bank's features:</h4>\n<h4>– Free bank card issuance<br />\n– Ability to deposit and withdraw money from other banks<br />\n– Ability to pay various bills and statements<br />\n– Providing you with financial information and reports to help you better manage your finances<br />\n– 24-hour support via phone call or online chat</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h2>Varo Bank:</h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Varo Bank is also an online bank that is accessible through a mobile app. This bank provides the following features:</h4>\n<h4>– Free bank card issuance<br />\n– Ability to deposit and withdraw money from other banks<br />\n– Ability to pay various bills and statements<br />\n– Providing financial reports and suggestions to improve your financial management<br />\n– Access to personal and business loans online</h4>\n\n\n\n<h3>Ally Bank and Varo Bank are both known as neobanks and offer similar features to their customers. Below, we examine some of the features of these two banks:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3>Ally Bank: This bank provides its customers with a credit card and through its app and website allows them to manage their account, transfer money, pay bills, and review financial transactions. In addition, Ally Bank allows its customers to invest in certificate of deposit (CD) and high-yield savings accounts, and in addition, it also provides auto, educational, and home loans.</h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>Varo Bank: This bank provides its customers with a credit card and a pain-free (ATM) card and through its app and website allows them to manage their account, pay bills, transfer money, and review financial transactions. Varo Bank also allows its customers to invest in high-yield savings accounts and in addition, it also provides personal, educational, and home loans.</h3>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2>What are the features of the Monese neobank?</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3>Monese neobank is an online bank that allows you to open a bank account in minutes with your own identity, without the need for an address or permanent residence. Unlike many traditional banks, Monese has fewer restrictions for its customers, and you can have complete control over your bank account with the help of your smart devices. Some of Monese's features include:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4>Opening a bank account in minutes: New customers can open a bank account in Monese in less than 5 minutes.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Providing bank cards: Monese gives you an international Mastercard or Visa bank card as well as a dedicated mobile bank card.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>24-hour support: You can access Monese's 24-hour support and get help with your questions.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>International money transfer: You can easily transfer money to other countries using Monese.</h4>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h4>Complete control over the bank account: You can access viewing transactions, blocking cards, setting purchase limits, financial notifications, and access to some other features through the Monese app.</h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4>Monese has advantages such as withdrawing cash from ATMs worldwide, sending money to other Monese users with extremely high speed, the ability to pay with a mobile phone via Google Pay and Apple Pay, and also provides analytics for its users to track expenses and budgeting. Additionally, as a digital bank, it allows its customers to open their account completely online and without any physical presence.</h4>\n<h4>Monese differs from some other neobanks in that it provides banking services to all individuals who have permanent residence in the European Union (even if they are not citizens). In addition, Monese allows users in some European countries to receive tax refunds, which is often needed for immigrants.</h4><h4>The exact number of Monese users is not available, but as one of the neobanks managed by a London-based technology company, this bank has managed to expand its market across Europe by offering innovative digital banking services.</h4>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h4>Like other neobanks, Monese's exact value is difficult to determine as it is a private company and there is no public announcement regarding its value. However, according to the company's announcement in 2021, Monese had over 2 million users, which indicates significant growth for this bank. Also, in 2019, Monese managed to raise $60 million in capital, which shows its attractiveness to investors.</h4>\nComparison of Leading Neobanks Worldwide\n\n<h3>So far, we have examined the most famous neobanks in the world, but we ourselves are designing a new neobank system</h3>\n\n\n\n<h3> We invite investors to invest in our <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%da%82%da%af%d9%88%d9%86%d9%87-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%da%b8%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%be-%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%da%a9%d9%86/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a> <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%ad-%d8%a7%d9%88%d9%84%db%8c%d9%87-pitch-deck-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%86%da%a9%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%a6%d9%88-%d8%a8%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">neobank</a